                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Last week, I was humbled to join the Minnesota National Security Ecosystem and @BettyMcCollum04 for a roundtable discussion on the critical work being done by medical innovators across our state.\n\nWhether through combat and emergency medicine, research, or technology, the medical innovation happening in Minnesota is a major contributor to our military's force readiness. As a member of the @HASCRepublicans, I've been proud to work to deliver for our service members, strengthen our industrial base, and ensure businesses of all sizes can contribute to our national security.",
