                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "A year ago, I had the privilege of attending the groundbreaking for @bravozuluhouse. This week, I had the opportunity to see that vision become a reality at the grand opening ceremony. From spiritual coaching and mental health counseling to meaningful work opportunities, Bravo Zulu House provides veterans in #MN01 with the care they have earned and deserve. The work being done here is nothing short of inspiring, and it has been an honor to watch this project come to life.",
