                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This week, I hosted a veteran\u2019s roundtable to hear directly from those who served how Congress can help address the challenges veterans are facing. Our veterans deserve local access to mental health care, peer support, and transition resources, without having to travel for hours for help. It\u2019s time we brought these vital services closer to home, which is why I\u2019m leading legislation to bring a VA Vet Center to the heart of south-central Minnesota. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8#SupportOurVeterans #MankatoVetCenter",
