                "text": "Families across #MN01 rely on nonprofit community health centers for affordable medical and dental services. I recently met with Open Door Health Center to talk with their team about the shortage of physicians and dentists impacting their services and ways we can work to keep talented healthcare professionals in rural areas, especially for the many patients who depend on federally qualified health centers (FQHCs) for their care. Thanks for having me!",
