                "text": "Last week, I spoke with Freeborn County Board of Commissioners Chairman Brad Edwin about recent issues impacting the county\u2019s ICE detention facility, including delayed federal payments and medical expense concerns that my office has been helping to resolve. It\u2019s an honor to represent #MN01 in Congress, and I am committed to ensuring counties aren\u2019t left footing the bill for federal or state responsibilities.",
